[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 2402.069, "timestamp": "00:40:02", "text": "没关系。所以，我不想再用我的Reddit了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2405.03, "timestamp": "00:40:05", "text": "子版块将被填满“喜欢”之类的内容"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2408.79, "timestamp": "00:40:08", "text": "我的意思是，我的一部分确实有点……哦，天哪"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2412.79, "timestamp": "00:40:12", "text": "下周我会做得很好。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2416.95, "timestamp": "00:40:16", "text": "总是忘记还有个子版块"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2420.95, "timestamp": "00:40:20", "text": "对我来说，就像对一个社区一样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2423.67, "timestamp": "00:40:23", "text": "你们大多数人还没到那一步，但是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2426.31, "timestamp": "00:40:26", "text": "你们大多数人还是不用Reddit。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2429.99, "timestamp": "00:40:29", "text": "所以一切都很好，但是，你知道的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2433.51, "timestamp": "00:40:33", "text": "所以呃"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2438.63, "timestamp": "00:40:38", "text": "所以 Snowy 将成为我的时间戳。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2442.069, "timestamp": "00:40:42", "text": "我忘了写下我制作的东西"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2444.069, "timestamp": "00:40:44", "text": "分隔符"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2449.03, "timestamp": "00:40:49", "text": "是为下次直播准备的，嗯。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2451.829, "timestamp": "00:40:51", "text": "这会帮助我……嗯，是的，我会"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2455.91, "timestamp": "00:40:55", "text": "呃，让你成为另一种类型。哦，等等，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2457.829, "timestamp": "00:40:57", "text": "我，我先写下来。"}]